# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# card-break-overlay .gitignore
# Reviewed 2026-08-18. Repaired and extended 2026-09-20.
#
# ⚠️  THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. github.com/tradesecretsunlocked/card-break-overlay
# Anything committed here is readable by anyone on the internet. Before adding
# a file, ask: would I post this publicly? Bridge keys, client lists, internal
# standards and SOPs are NO.
#
# READ THIS FIRST. This repo is served by GitHub Pages. Anything an overlay
# loads at runtime MUST stay tracked or live clients break:
#   overlays/<client>/index.html   and that client's media in the same folder
#   images/**                      shared team logos and FX used by overlays
# Never add a blanket *.png / *.mp4 rule. Unreferenced media is excluded by
# explicit path at the bottom of this file instead.
#
# NOTE: adding a path here does NOT remove it from GitHub if it is already
# tracked. It must also be untracked with:  git rm --cached --  <path>
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Build artifacts & backups (never commit) ──
*.zip
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
*extension-template*
# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/
*_to_delete*

# ── Secrets / env ──
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
credentials*.json
service-account*.json

# ── BRIDGE KEYS. Added 2026-09-20 after these were found tracked in a PUBLIC repo. ──
# A bridge key lets anyone POST fake sale events onto that client's live overlay
# and subscribe to their real sales feed. Never commit one in bulk.
bridge/migration-keys.sql
bridge/setup-bridge-keys.sql
bridge/*keys*.sql
**/*bridge-keys*
**/*bridge_keys*

# ── Baked per-client extension builds. Each carries a live bridgeKey. ──
# `*-extension/` below does not match `extension-unified`, which is why 133 of
# these were public. Delivered to clients as a zip; never published.
extension-unified/_builds/
**/_builds/
# ...but keep the env TEMPLATE, it documents required vars and holds no secrets
!*.env.example
!bridge/.env.example

# ── Node tooling ──
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log

# ── Python tooling (graphics generator runs locally only) ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working areas — local only, nothing here is served
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*_drafts*
_to_delete/
archived/
overlays/_staging*
overlays/_drafts*
*logo-sync.json
*sync_logos.py
# docs/ — canon markdown IS versioned (Mike, 2026-08-18). The Standard links to
# these, so a clone must have them. Only the Word exports and scratch stay out.
docs/_to_delete/
docs/*.docx
*untrack-local-only*
*TSU_Platform_Growth_Plan*
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client extension builds — LOCAL ONLY.
# These carry a baked per-client bridgeKey and are NOT loaded by GitHub Pages.
# They are delivered to the client as a zip, so there is no reason to publish
# them. Covers the root <client>-extension/ folders and any nested extension/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*-extension/
*-extension-*/
extension-template/
extension-UPDATED-*/
tsu-extension-*/
**/extension/
**/loupe-extension/
*CLAUDE.md
*claude/skills/tsu-overlay-troubleshoot
*docs/*
*archived*
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Graphics generation — source + build scaffolding, run locally
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
graphics/_**
**/_build/
*.bat
generate_graphics.py
prep_anchor.py
**/anchors/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Backup / scratch copies of overlays. The live file is always index.html.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/OLD-*.html
**/old-index.html
**/*-Copy.html
**/* Copy.html
**/git-index.html
**/index-*.html
**/*-backup.html
**/*-old.html

# ── Office docs — the .md is the source of truth, the .docx is an export ──
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.xlsx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unreferenced heavy media — kept locally as design source, not published.
# Verified 2026-08-18: zero references across every tracked html/js/css/json.
# Re-check with the reference scan before re-adding any of these.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
images/fx/glass-shatter_1.webm
images/fx/old.webm
images/logos/see2-pick1-vid.mp4
images/logos/stash-or-pass-green.mp4
images/logos/see2pick1-green2.mp4
images/logos/See2-pick1-green.mp4
images/logos/luxcards-clear.png
overlays/h-vault/h-vault-package/

# ── Local server scratch ──
server/node_modules/
bridge/node_modules/
overlays/**/*.mov
